  "description": "White A330 freighter with a navy aft fuselage behind a curved sweep that rises from the belly under the wing's trailing edge to the fin's root, three thin pinstripes (sky blue, navy, sky blue) running up ahead of it. Navy fin with a white leading edge and the Awesome Cargo 'A' (a white A crossed by a sky-blue swoosh). Over the forward fuselage the navy-and-sky-blue 'A' followed by 'wesome Cargo' in grey, spelling 'Awesome Cargo'; the same under the belly. Navy engines; navy winglets with a small 'A'.",
