      "note": "A330-200P2F XA-LRL, left side from below, on approach, 2026-05-30. Fitted to shapes/A332.json (forward door pinned, camera 13° below): the navy sweep and the three pinstripes (traced), the white tail cone, the fin's 'A', the title's ends and height, the belly title."
    },
    {
