      "accessed": "2026-11-20",
      "note": "XA-LRL, left side from ahead, at Zhengzhou, 2025-11-30: colours in daylight; the white fin leading edge and dorsal fillet; navy engines; the winglet's 'A'. Too much perspective to fit well (26 px off at the nose): used by eye."
