  "notes": "Awesome Cargo is the trading name of TM Aerolíneas (ICAO WIN, callsign TEME AIRLINES in FAA JO 7340.2), Mexico City Felipe Ángeles; A330-200P2Fs XA-LRL and XA-DUR seen flying as WIN (adsb.lol, hexdb.io), a third A330F reported delivered (not checked on Commons). Measured on XA-LRL (2026-05-30, left from below): the left title runs x 0.172-0.339 behind the 'A' (0.122-0.170), capitals (the C) about 1.0 m, lowercase about 0.7 m; the navy's leading edge meets the belly at x 0.73 and the crown at 0.82; the tail cone (from 0.97) is white. The pinstripes are drawn as slivers about 0.25 m wide from traced centrelines. The right side is from a 2023 photo of the same aircraft before conversion (by eye, low): the 'A' sits at the title's aft end there. The belly title and its 'A' are read off two photos from below, partly hidden by the gear: placement low. A customer's 'MT International Silkexpress' sticker aft of the wing on XA-LRL in 2026 and the registration with a Mexican flag are not drawn. The winglet's 'A' is small and drawn on both faces. Colours by eye; no brand colours published.",
  "history": "New in the LAX round (2026-11-20); Awesome Cargo had no scheme here before."
}
